    "body": "## Summary\n- Bump `nvidia-modelopt` from 0.47.0 to 0.48.0rc1 in `pyproject.toml` and `uv.lock`.\n- Required by #5812.\n\n## Notes\n- modelopt 0.48.0rc1 has the same dependency list as 0.47.0, so the `uv.lock` change is limited to the override specifier, package version, and wheel URL/hash. A full `uv lock` (uv 0.7.2) introduced unrelated marker churn on other packages, so the lock was edited surgically; `uv lock --check` passes and the `revision` header is unchanged.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
