      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "<!-- nemo-ci-review-impact:v1 ceiling=none -->\n\nNo verified defects found. The [project override](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/blob/7b520bafccefb852c7b912000dde52dc0b10b560/pyproject.toml#L140), [lockfile override](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/blob/7b520bafccefb852c7b912000dde52dc0b10b560/uv.lock#L32), and [locked package/wheel version](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/blob/7b520bafccefb852c7b912000dde52dc0b10b560/uv.lock#L3060-L3083) consistently select `0.48.0rc1`; the NVIDIA registry and existing dependency edges are preserved.\n\nStatic review only: tests and lock/install commands were not executed, and the remote wheel hash and upstream metadata could not be independently verified. Recommended container checks: `uv lock --check` and `uv sync --locked`.\n\n### Suggested test cases\n- [`test_collect_modelopt_quant_metadata_skips_unquantized_tasks`](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/blob/7b520bafccefb852c7b912000dde52dc0b10b560/tests/unit_tests/models/test_modelopt_utils.py#L199) — retain the NVFP4 metadata and unquantized-task assertions with the new version.\n- [`TestQATWorkflow.test_qat_workflow`](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/blob/7b520bafccefb852c7b912000dde52dc0b10b560/tests/functional_tests/test_groups/quantization/test_qat_workflow.py#L187), `llama32_1b` — PTQ and training succeed; checkpoint tracker records iteration 10.\n- [`TestLlamaDistillRecipes.test_llama_distill_recipes`](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/blob/7b520bafccefb852c7b912000dde52dc0b10b560/tests/functional_tests/test_groups/recipes/test_llama_recipes_distill_3b-1b.py#L67), `llama32_3b-1b`, TP=2 — complete ten iterations and verify saved checkpoints.\n- No perf tests impacted.\n\n> **Note:** formal approval is not available for this request, so this review is posted as a comment only.\n\n*Review generated by codex*\n\n<!-- nemo-ci-review-rendering:inline-v1 -->\n<!-- nemo-ci-formal-review:6f00502e2f9fce2b809321f242be9c58f740ab8d60b382af7ca5943bd1094e88:e5799e8e4e05cbf087b43b4014882b34fd9c1b5c2cf2cfd8e0672aa11fea402b -->",
